    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. one more thing though—sometimes clients worry about \"hidden\" costs or unexpected little drags on their returns that don't show up in the expense ratio. can you explain why those small, unexpected costs sometimes pop up in these fund types? like, what causes those minor discrepancies in performance?",
